    <node id="fab4f539-2cdc-4dc9-b176-82ccb42737ac">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Policy Payment &amp; Benefits Overview","text":"━━━━━━━━━━━━\n3.1 Your monthly premium is $87.50 and will never increase.\n\n3.2 Premiums are automatically deducted from your bank account \n    on the 1st of each month.\n\n3.3 If a payment fails, we will try again on the 15th.\n\n3.4 GRACE PERIOD: If payment is not received, you have 30 days \n    to pay before the policy cancels.\n\n3.5 You can change to annual or quarterly payments if you prefer.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n4. CASH VALUE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n4.1 This policy builds cash value slowly. Guaranteed cash values \n    are shown in the table we sent you.\n\n4.2 Approximate cash value after 10 years: $3,200\n\n4.3 You can borrow against the cash value or surrender the policy \n    for the cash value at any time.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n5. WHAT IS NOT COVERED\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n5.1 SUICIDE: If death occurs by suicide within 2 years of the \n    issue date, we will only return the premiums paid.\n\n5.2 NO OTHER EXCLUSIONS: This policy has no war exclusion, no \n    aviation exclusion, and no travel restrictions.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n6. HOW TO FILE A CLAIM\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nThe beneficiary should call us at 1-800-COMFORT or send:\n  • Death certificate (certified copy)\n  • Completed claim form\n  • This policy (if available)\n\n","summary":"This life insurance policy features a fixed monthly premium of $87.50, auto-deducted on the 1st of each month with a retry on the 15th if failed; a 30-day grace period exists before cancellation. It accumulates guaranteed cash value over time—approximately $3,200 after 10 years—and allows borrowers to access funds or surrender the policy. Coverage excludes payouts for suicide within two years but includes no war, aviation, or travel-related exclusions. Beneficiaries may file claims via phone or mail using a certified death certificate, claim form, and the original policy document.","topics":["Insurance Policy Terms","Premium Payments","Cash Value Features","Claim Process"],"facts":[{"name":"Monthly Premium Amount","sentence":"Your monthly premium is $87.50.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["monthly premium","payment terms","policy cost"],"entities":[{"name":"$87.50","type":"AMOUNT","role":"fixed monthly cost","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"the 1st of each month","type":"DATE","role":"scheduled deduction day","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"the 15th","type":"DATE","role":"retry payment date","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"30 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace period duration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"GRACE PERIOD","type":"CONCEPT","role":"window for late payment without cancellation","relational_anchors":["30 days"]},{"name":"annual or quarterly payments","type":"PAYMENT_METHOD","role":"alternative billing frequency options","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$3,200","type":"AMOUNT","role":"estimated cash value after ten years","relational_anchors":["after 10 years"]},{"name":"CASH VALUE","type":"CONCEPT","role":"accumulated monetary benefit of policy","relational_anchors":["$3,200","after 10 years"]},{"name":"borrow against the cash value","type":"ACTION","role":"available use of accumulated funds","relational_anchors":["cash value"]},{"name":"surrender the policy for the cash value","type":"ACTION","role":"option to terminate and receive payout","relational_anchors":["cash value"]},{"name":"SUICIDE","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"death cause limiting refund during first two years","relational_anchors":["within 2 years of the issue date"]},{"name":"we will only return the premiums paid","type":"CONDITION","role":"refund limitation under suicide clause","relational_anchors":["SUICIDE","within 2 years of the issue date"]},{"name":"NO OTHER EXCLUSIONS","type":"CONCEPT","role":"absence of special risk limitations","relational_anchors":["no war exclusion","no aviation exclusion","no travel restrictions"]},{"name":"1-800-COMFORT","type":"CONTACT_INFO","role":"claim filing phone number","relational_anchors":["call us"]},{"name":"Death certificate (certified copy)","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"required proof of death","relational_anchors":["completed claim form","this policy"]},{"name":"Completed claim form","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"mandatory submission for processing","relational_anchors":["Death certificate","this policy"]},{"name":"This policy (if available)","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"document required for claim settlement","relational_anchors":["Death certificate","Completed claim form"]}]},{"name":"Fixed Monthly Premium","sentence":"Your monthly premium will never increase.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["monthly premium","premium stability","fixed cost"],"entities":[{"name":"$87.50","type":"AMOUNT","role":"fixed monthly cost","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"the 1st of each month","type":"DATE","role":"scheduled deduction day","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"the 15th","type":"DATE","role":"retry payment date","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"30 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace period duration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"GRACE PERIOD","type":"CONCEPT","role":"window for late payment without cancellation","relational_anchors":["30 days"]},{"name":"annual or quarterly payments","type":"PAYMENT_METHOD","role":"alternative billing frequency options","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$3,200","type":"AMOUNT","role":"estimated cash value after ten years","relational_anchors":["after 10 years"]},{"name":"CASH VALUE","type":"CONCEPT","role":"accumulated monetary benefit of policy","relational_anchors":["$3,200","after 10 years"]},{"name":"borrow against the cash value","type":"ACTION","role":"available use of accumulated funds","relational_anchors":["cash value"]},{"name":"