      <data key="d3">The policy number uniquely identifies the insurance contract, which includes the specified monthly premium of $87.50 as part of its terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">identifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="26ef68ef-501a-4eda-9c9d-67ca214eec19" target="430bd8b6-7216-4e08-9161-dd3bfe5254cb">
      <data key="d3">The policy number CC-FE-2024-9903 uniquely identifies the insurance contract whose terms include a permanently stable monthly premium.</data>
      <data key="d4">identifies</data>
