      <data key="d3">The guaranteed issue whole life nature of the policy ensures a permanent coverage structure where benefits are payable upon death. Since Linda Sue Johnson is named the sole primary beneficiary, she is legally entitled to receive the full death benefit under the terms of such policies.</data>
