      <data key="d3">The policy's goal of covering funeral and final expenses is made more accessible by eliminating the need for health questions, allowing quicker and simpler enrollment.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
