    <edge source="95682703-5aa3-4502-9d77-774a9d121b12" target="eb3591d2-1da2-424c-bb9b-68881a3de492">
      <data key="d3">The policy's primary goal of covering funeral costs is realized through tiered payouts that depend on the timing of death. Fact_sentence_2 details how early death results in a reduced benefit, reflecting the gradual build-up of coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
