      <data key="d3">The policy's primary aim is to assist with funeral and final costs, and its design includes tiered payouts based on when death occurs; specifically, if death happens in Year 2, beneficiaries receive 70% of the face amount, ensuring partial support aligned with the policy’s core purpose.</data>
