      <data key="d3">The absence of health questions makes the policy accessible to more applicants, reinforcing its appeal alongside the guarantee of stable, unchanging premiums that ensure affordability over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
