      <data key="d3">The lack of health questions ensures broad accessibility, supporting the guarantee that coverage remains unchanged throughout the policy term.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="649977f1-a457-41f0-8748-cdeb1357540d" target="eb3591d2-1da2-424c-bb9b-68881a3de492">
      <data key="d3">The absence of health questions makes the policy easier to obtain, while the reduced payout in Year 1 reflects an initial limitation tied to the policy's growth timeline.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
