    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="fdbea615-6c8b-4e16-b3c0-1e0700ab9386">
      <data key="d3">The assurance that premiums will never rise reinforces the simplicity and reliability of the policy, making it well-suited for individuals seeking straightforward, stable coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="95682703-5aa3-4502-9d77-774a9d121b12">
      <data key="d3">Fixed premiums enhance the policy’s ability to reliably fulfill its primary purpose by guaranteeing consistent cost coverage throughout the term.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="592cc5a1-980d-42c3-99cc-7f855ebc5b95">
      <data key="d3">Fixed premiums ensure predictable costs over time, reinforcing the policy’s user-friendly nature already highlighted by the lack of medical exams.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="649977f1-a457-41f0-8748-cdeb1357540d">
      <data key="d3">Fixed premiums provide consistent financial planning benefits, complementing the lack of health underwriting by enhancing overall policy attractiveness and user convenience.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="553b7cff-2218-40d7-b664-1ae094b8052a">
      <data key="d3">The guarantee that premiums will never increase supports the assurance that coverage remains constant over time, reinforcing financial predictability and sustained benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace">
      <data key="d3">Fixed monthly premiums ensure consistent contributions, allowing the policy to accumulate cash value gradually over time through sustained payment behavior.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="09323260-bd8d-471c-b093-b779cff6374f">
      <data key="d3">The guarantee of stable, unchanging premiums ensures predictable payment history, making it possible for the policyholder’s accumulated premiums to be fully refunded upon death in Year 2.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="9b280eb9-7364-4c28-8f15-917ff673f5f0">
      <data key="d3">The fixed premium ensures consistent payment capability, allowing the insured to maintain coverage through Year 2 and beyond, where full benefits become accessible upon death.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="52a20188-9d73-4368-9f9f-8eca7f5ffd71">
      <data key="d3">The fixed premium ensures predictable costs, which complements the guarantee that all payments are returned in case of accidental death, enhancing trust in the policy’s fairness.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="bc3a5da6-49c7-4acb-96bb-01998b3ff196">
      <data key="d3">The statement that the premium will never increase ensures the consistency of the $87.50 monthly payment, making it a stable financial commitment.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d" target="ae8923d1-8746-41d5-842e-11a42617a408">
      <data key="d3">The premium remains constant over time, ensuring predictable costs; this stable amount is then automatically withdrawn from the policyholder’s bank account through scheduled deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">stabilizes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="22d5b4e1-adb1-4e69-a60a-7bdab5d573bf" target="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">has fixed premium guarantee</data>
    </edge>
