    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="fdbea615-6c8b-4e16-b3c0-1e0700ab9386">
      <data key="d3">A key attribute of whole life insurance policies like this one is that they build cash value; thus, the presence of growing cash value supports the characterization of the policy as a whole life product.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="8d1da4c9-850a-460c-b431-6c03f074655d">
      <data key="d3">The gradual build-up of cash value reflects the policy’s design where regular, unchanging premiums contribute to long-term financial growth within the contract.</data>
      <data key="d4">enabled by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="9b280eb9-7364-4c28-8f15-917ff673f5f0">
      <data key="d3">The policy accumulates a small cash value over time, contributing to its overall financial structure. This gradual increase supports long-term benefits, though the full death benefit is only payable after a specific milestone date.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="bc3a5da6-49c7-4acb-96bb-01998b3ff196">
      <data key="d3">The policy's ability to build cash value over time depends on regular premium payments. Since the monthly premium is fixed at $87.50, it ensures predictable contributions that support long-term cash value accumulation.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="ae8923d1-8746-41d5-842e-11a42617a408">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s ability to build cash value depends on regular premium payments, which are facilitated by automatic deductions from the policyholder’s bank account.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6">
      <data key="d3">The steady growth of cash value over time depends on consistent payments, which are ensured by the permanently fixed monthly premium.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5">
      <data key="d3">The $87.50 monthly premium sustains the policy's ability to build cash value gradually over time, making it foundational to the accumulation process described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="38b66940-133b-4c2b-b3be-b28ab1f9d404">
      <data key="d3">The gradual buildup of cash value described in fact_sentence_1 enables the financial flexibility mentioned in fact_sentence_2, allowing policyholders to borrow against it.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="c3965e85-d864-4e4d-835c-0b95792ef2ca">
      <data key="d3">The policy's growing cash value, described in fact_sentence_1, supports the ability to surrender it for financial gain, as stated in fact_sentence_2.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="239e4a5a-194e-40ba-8b75-11eb0108b332">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s growing cash value complements its inclusive coverage terms, including the lack of a war exclusion, suggesting comprehensive protection designed for predictable long-term use.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="57d215cb-0353-4d3b-9902-ec5445951305">
      <data key="d3">The policy's growing cash value supports long-term financial utility, while the absence of an aviation exclusion enhances its broad coverage, making it more accessible and inclusive for diverse risk profiles.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="74ba7423-5179-49d9-89b2-ad4c817aeb2b">
      <data key="d3">The policy's growing cash value complements its broad coverage terms, including the absence of travel restrictions, enhancing overall financial flexibility and accessibility.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace" target="2c2ac373-cacf-48f8-8261-4cacaba45a95">
      <data key="d3">The gradual build-up of cash value supports the policy’s long-term viability despite its graded benefit structure, ensuring some return even during early years when payouts are limited.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
