      <data key="d3">The provision that all premiums are returned upon death in Year 1 relies on the nature of the policy being a simplified issue whole life insurance, which lacks medical underwriting but still offers defined payout terms based on duration.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
