      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies that in Year 1, only premiums paid are refunded upon death. Fact_sentence_2 expands on this by ensuring that even if death occurs outside Year 1, accidental causes result in full premium reimbursement.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
