      <data key="d3">A key feature of the policy is that it offers a 70% payout in Year 2, which contributes to fulfilling its main intent of covering funeral and final expenses, even though not at full capacity.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e22e896f-13b1-4f38-a1c7-bc95d30ab372" target="592cc5a1-980d-42c3-99cc-7f855ebc5b95">
      <data key="d3">The condition of receiving a 70% payout in Year 2 depends on qualifying for the policy, which requires no medical exam, thus linking the payout rule to the low-barrier enrollment process.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
