    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="fdbea615-6c8b-4e16-b3c0-1e0700ab9386">
      <data key="d3">An accidental death triggers an immediate full payout, which aligns with the features of a simplified issue whole life insurance policy designed for quick access to benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="95682703-5aa3-4502-9d77-774a9d121b12">
      <data key="d3">The rule allowing immediate full benefits upon accidental death serves the broader purpose of the policy—to provide funds for funeral and final expenses—by guaranteeing swift access to the death benefit.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="592cc5a1-980d-42c3-99cc-7f855ebc5b95">
      <data key="d3">Immediate payment upon accidental death underscores the policy’s responsiveness, reinforcing its appeal even though it does not require medical exams during application.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="649977f1-a457-41f0-8748-cdeb1357540d">
      <data key="d3">Immediate payment of the full benefit in case of accidental death underscores the policy’s strength in providing urgent financial relief, reinforcing its attractiveness even without health screening, since eligibility isn’t tied to medical history.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="553b7cff-2218-40d7-b664-1ae094b8052a">
      <data key="d3">Immediate payment of the full benefit in case of accidental death depends on the policy’s stable coverage, which is guaranteed not to decrease by fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="eb3591d2-1da2-424c-bb9b-68881a3de492">
      <data key="d3">Accidental death results in immediate full payment, rendering the time-dependent payout rules in fact_sentence_1 irrelevant when such circumstances occur.</data>
      <data key="d4">supersedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="07cbca12-0349-48ac-8e69-1106566c8841">
      <data key="d3">Accidental death results in an immediate payment of the full benefit, which is defined by the $10,000 face amount specified in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="e22e896f-13b1-4f38-a1c7-bc95d30ab372">
      <data key="d3">Accidental death triggers immediate full payment, overriding the reduced benefits applicable in Year 2 due to normal mortality.</data>
      <data key="d4">overrules</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="4ad858e8-94fc-41ca-be39-85f0078c060c">
      <data key="d3">Accidental death qualifies for instant access to the full $10,000 benefit, making the payout independent of the standard waiting period.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="52a20188-9d73-4368-9f9f-8eca7f5ffd71">
      <data key="d3">The immediate full benefit for accidental death includes all premiums paid by the policyholder, ensuring comprehensive financial support.</data>
      <data key="d4">explains</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="ef46c5f5-12c1-4121-869f-787b80ab2ee0">
      <data key="d3">The immediate full benefit for accidental death depends on clearly defining what qualifies as such an event. Without the definition in fact_sentence_2, it would be unclear when the benefit applies.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="b545d862-f828-4173-afa0-6475ca5c91fd">
      <data key="d3">The immediate full benefit for accidental death depends on whether the death occurs within 90 days of the incident, limiting when the benefit applies despite the general "immediate" clause.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155" target="2c2ac373-cacf-48f8-8261-4cacaba45a95">
      <data key="d3">The immediate full payout for accidental death overrides the graded benefit restriction, ensuring full compensation despite the policy’s limited underwriting process.</data>
      <data key="d4">exception to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
