    <edge source="b545d862-f828-4173-afa0-6475ca5c91fd" target="07cbca12-0349-48ac-8e69-1106566c8841">
      <data key="d3">A claim for accidental death requires the incident to occur within 90 days, though the maximum payout remains capped at the $10,000 face amount.</data>
      <data key="d4">limits payout</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b545d862-f828-4173-afa0-6475ca5c91fd" target="4ad858e8-94fc-41ca-be39-85f0078c060c">
      <data key="d3">Accidental deaths require occurrence within 90 days to qualify for benefits, ensuring timely reporting, though the actual payout remains capped at the stated $10,000.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b545d862-f828-4173-afa0-6475ca5c91fd" target="b9f15b6a-c2d0-46dd-9ea1-6621511e8155">
      <data key="d3">The requirement that accidental death occur within 90 days ensures that only timely fatalities qualify for the immediate full benefit outlined in the first statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b545d862-f828-4173-afa0-6475ca5c91fd" target="52a20188-9d73-4368-9f9f-8eca7f5ffd71">
      <data key="d3">A death caused by an accident qualifies for the full payout—including all premiums—if it happens within 90 days of the event; otherwise, the accelerated benefit does not apply.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b545d862-f828-4173-afa0-6475ca5c91fd" target="ef46c5f5-12c1-4121-869f-787b80ab2ee0">
      <data key="d3">For an accidental death to qualify for benefits, it must not only meet the definitional criteria of being caused by a sudden, unexpected injury but also happen within 90 days of the triggering event.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b545d862-f828-4173-afa0-6475ca5c91fd" target="2c2ac373-cacf-48f8-8261-4cacaba45a95">
      <data key="d3">The 90-day requirement for accidental death payments aligns with the existence of a graded benefit schedule by emphasizing exceptions—accidents grant instant full benefits despite timing constraints, which mitigates the impact of the gradual increase in coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
