    <edge source="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5" target="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12">
      <data key="d3">The $87.50 monthly premium is scheduled for automatic deduction from the policyholder’s bank account on the 1st of every month, ensuring consistent payment fulfillment.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5" target="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0">
      <data key="d3">The $87.50 monthly premium triggers an automated payment process that includes a retry on the 15th if the first deduction fails, ensuring continuity of coverage despite temporary issues.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5" target="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2">
      <data key="d3">The fixed monthly premium of $87.50 establishes the financial commitment required, and the 30-day grace period offers a safety net allowing delayed payment without immediate cancellation.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5" target="12f1e363-6499-41cd-a6c7-5fcd25bfbdae">
      <data key="d3">The $87.50 monthly premium establishes the financial obligation that, if unmet, triggers the policy's cancellation process after the 30-day grace period.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5" target="81788182-7312-430d-b245-031e37d5c627">
      <data key="d3">The fixed monthly premium of $87.50 provides the basis for understanding the cost of coverage, enabling the possibility of switching to less frequent annual payments.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
