      <data key="d3">A fixed monthly premium of $87.50 supports the policy’s ability to accumulate guaranteed cash value over time through sustained payments.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
