      <data key="d3">A consistent monthly premium of $87.50 contributes to the gradual buildup of guaranteed cash value over time, enabling future access through loans.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
