      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2">
      <data key="d3">The guarantee of a stable monthly premium provides predictability, enabling the policyholder to plan around the 30-day grace period when making timely payments.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="12f1e363-6499-41cd-a6c7-5fcd25bfbdae">
      <data key="d3">A fixed premium ensures predictable payments, reducing the risk of missed payments due to cost increases. This reliability helps maintain coverage, preventing cancellation when timely payment occurs within the grace period.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="81788182-7312-430d-b245-031e37d5c627">
      <data key="d3">The fixed monthly premium ensures predictable costs, enabling the possibility of switching to less frequent annual payments while maintaining cost certainty.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="71633f7c-5dc5-48fa-ac41-c71eba6fc01c">
      <data key="d3">The fixed nature of the monthly premium ensures predictable costs, enabling the possibility of switching to less frequent quarterly payments while maintaining cost certainty.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373">
      <data key="d3">A fixed monthly premium ensures steady contributions, enabling reliable and continuous buildup of cash value over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="33bb0f3a-ce2b-40f6-b221-f738e97e68f6">
      <data key="d3">A fixed monthly premium ensures steady contributions, enabling the gradual buildup of guaranteed cash value over time, culminating in approximately $3,200 after a decade.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="38b66940-133b-4c2b-b3be-b28ab1f9d404">
      <data key="d3">The guarantee of a stable monthly premium ensures predictable costs, enabling consistent accumulation of cash value over time, which in turn supports the ability to borrow against it later.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="c3965e85-d864-4e4d-835c-0b95792ef2ca">
      <data key="d3">A stable, unchanging premium ensures consistent funding of the policy, allowing predictable growth of the guaranteed cash value over time, which enables eventual surrender for cash.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="5896cff7-b1d1-4a7d-97cc-db08bcac9b87">
      <data key="d3">A fixed premium ensures long-term affordability and continuity of coverage, increasing the likelihood that the policy remains active and physically accessible when needed for claims processing.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="f0521375-da25-4a33-b3ef-2565e3a91ace">
      <data key="d3">A fixed monthly premium enables reliable, uninterrupted buildup of cash value, making it possible for the policy to accumulate value predictably.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="ae6d0ff9-f5aa-4f56-b0e3-b2f05381b7ef">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 confirms the permanence of the premium rate, providing contextual support for the accuracy and reliability of the stated $87.50 figure in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="12aa272e-14b0-400c-bfb5-be55b12c5085">
      <data key="d3">The assurance that premiums will never increase validates the consistency of the monthly payment obligation mentioned in fact_sentence_1, confirming long-term financial stability.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="14c9a49e-b750-4ae4-9750-5cf3f57becb9">
      <data key="d3">The promise that the monthly premium will never rise complements the payment method of bank draft by ensuring predictable, stable billing through automatic deduction.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The guarantee of a non-increasing monthly premium ensures stable policy coverage, thereby securing the intended payout to Linda Sue Johnson upon the insured's passing.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">The fact that Linda Sue Johnson is the designated beneficiary under a policy with permanently fixed premiums underscores the stable, lifelong coverage intended for her inheritance upon Dorothy Mae Johnson’s passing.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
