    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5">
      <data key="d3">The automatic deduction on the 1st of each month applies specifically to the $87.50 monthly premium required under the policy terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6">
      <data key="d3">Automated deductions ensure timely payments without requiring manual action, supporting the reliability of paying the unchanged premium outlined in sentence 1.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0">
      <data key="d3">The automatic deduction on the 1st triggers a backup attempt if it fails, ensuring continuity in payment processing.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="12f1e363-6499-41cd-a6c7-5fcd25bfbdae">
      <data key="d3">The automatic monthly deduction ensures consistent payments; if missed, it triggers the grace period, leading to potential cancellation if unresolved.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2">
      <data key="d3">When a payment fails due to insufficient funds or other issues during the automatic deduction on the 1st, the system initiates a 30-day grace period to allow late payment without immediate cancellation.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373">
      <data key="d3">Regular automatic deductions ensure consistent funding, allowing the policy’s cash value to accumulate steadily over time through sustained contributions.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="5da67648-ce09-4542-beb6-73a666a8a6f5">
      <data key="d3">The automatic deduction of premiums ensures steady contributions toward the policy’s growth, which supports the accumulation of guaranteed cash value over time. This financial consistency underpins the figures presented in the previous table.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="38b66940-133b-4c2b-b3be-b28ab1f9d404">
      <data key="d3">Regular monthly premium payments lead to the gradual buildup of cash value, enabling future loan options against that value.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="33bb0f3a-ce2b-40f6-b221-f738e97e68f6">
      <data key="d3">The automatic monthly premium deduction ensures consistent funding that supports the growth of the policy’s accumulated cash value over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="c3965e85-d864-4e4d-835c-0b95792ef2ca">
      <data key="d3">The regular monthly premium payments ensure continued coverage, enabling the accumulation of cash value that becomes available upon surrender. This supports the ability to redeem the policy's worth later.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="d8c49e46-f3e7-4910-b951-a173ce225f4b">
      <data key="d3">The automatic deduction of premiums ensures consistent funding of the policy, which supports its continued validity. This ongoing payment condition indirectly affects whether the suicide clause applies, since the policy must remain active at the time of death.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="ae6d0ff9-f5aa-4f56-b0e3-b2f05381b7ef">
      <data key="d3">The $87.50 monthly premium is scheduled for automatic withdrawal on the 1st of every month, aligning with the stated fixed cost of the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="12aa272e-14b0-400c-bfb5-be55b12c5085">
      <data key="d3">The automatic deduction system described in fact_sentence_2 ensures compliance with the requirement stated in fact_sentence_1 that premiums be paid on the first of each month.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="14c9a49e-b750-4ae4-9750-5cf3f57becb9">
      <data key="d3">Automatic monthly deductions on the 1st support the use of bank drafts as the preferred payment method, providing a reliable and systematic approach to collecting premiums consistently.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The automated monthly premium deduction ensures sustained policy validity, which directly supports the fulfillment of the promise to pay the primary beneficiary, Linda Sue Johnson, upon the insured’s death.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">The automatic deduction of premiums ensures that the policy remains in force, thereby securing the intended inheritance for Linda Sue Johnson, as stated in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
