    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5">
      <data key="d3">A second payment attempt on the 15th occurs specifically when the $87.50 monthly premium fails to deduct initially, reinforcing adherence to the scheduled payment requirement.</data>
      <data key="d4">responds to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6">
      <data key="d3">A retry on the 15th helps ensure payments are processed reliably, reducing risk of lapse and thereby preserving the benefit of a fixed, unchanging premium.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12">
      <data key="d3">A failed payment on the 1st leads to an additional retry on the 15th, maintaining system resilience.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2">
      <data key="d3">The system attempts a second payment on the 15th if the initial deduction fails, giving the policyholder another chance to avoid triggering the 30-day grace period that follows non-receipt of payment.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="12f1e363-6499-41cd-a6c7-5fcd25bfbdae">
      <data key="d3">A failed payment triggers a retry on the 15th, providing another chance to avoid default. If that attempt also fails, the policy cancels after the 30-day grace period ends.</data>
      <data key="d4">prevents cancellation</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="38b66940-133b-4c2b-b3be-b28ab1f9d404">
      <data key="d3">A delayed payment triggers a retry on the 15th, helping maintain active status so that the policy’s growing cash value remains accessible for future loans.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="ae6d0ff9-f5aa-4f56-b0e3-b2f05381b7ef">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s retry procedure on the 15th supports the consistent collection of the fixed $87.50 monthly premium established by the first fact.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="12aa272e-14b0-400c-bfb5-be55b12c5085">
      <data key="d3">The provision for a second payment attempt on the 15th supports the enforcement of the first-of-the-month payment rule by providing a safety net against missed deadlines.</data>
      <data key="d4">supprts</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="14c9a49e-b750-4ae4-9750-5cf3f57becb9">
      <data key="d3">The retry of failed payments on the 15th (fact_sentence_2) depends on the use of bank drafts (fact_sentence_1) as the default payment method, making it feasible to reattempt deductions without manual intervention.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The payment retry clause ensures ongoing policy validity, directly supporting the intended transfer of benefits to Linda Sue Johnson upon the insured’s passing.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a reliable payment system—including a retry on the 15th—is essential to ensure that Linda Sue Johnson can ultimately collect the death benefit, making the payment rules critical to fulfilling the beneficiary arrangement established in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables beneficiary payout</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
