    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5">
      <data key="d3">After missing a payment due to the $87.50 monthly premium, the 30-day grace period gives an opportunity to rectify the situation before policy termination.</data>
      <data key="d4">follows</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 30-day grace period offers buffer room for payment delays, which complements the assurance that premiums won’t rise despite potential lapses.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 30-day grace period ensures flexibility after a failed automatic deduction on the 1st of the month, allowing the policyholder time to resolve payment issues before consequences occur.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="456b2a23-de75-4427-a390-d5e6f9113ab0">
      <data key="d3">A 30-day grace period provides flexibility after a missed payment, during which a retry on the 15th offers a final opportunity to make up the payment before cancellation occurs.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="12f1e363-6499-41cd-a6c7-5fcd25bfbdae">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day grace period provides temporary leeway after a missed payment, allowing the policyholder to rectify the situation without immediate consequences. If payment remains unpaid by the end of this window, the policy terminates.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="38b66940-133b-4c2b-b3be-b28ab1f9d404">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day grace period gives policyholders extra time to make late payments, potentially preventing lapse and preserving eligibility to later access the policy’s accumulating cash value through borrowing.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="1e415829-df4a-46be-a508-364a4dce0af3">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day grace period ensures the policy remains active despite late payments, allowing sufficient time for the beneficiary to submit a claim without interruption due to lapse.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="d3df2cb3-d5f3-464e-bb7d-8d51ca52e9aa">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day grace period ensures continued coverage despite late payments, indirectly supporting timely claim eligibility by maintaining active status until resolution. This stability enables beneficiaries to proceed with claiming benefits without interruption.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="b43f297a-8427-44c6-b3de-7251ec721e34">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day grace period allows time to resolve unpaid premiums without immediate cancellation, potentially leading to future claim filings at the specified mailing address.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="3b7d9a54-071a-48e0-b6f6-572e65aacf95">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day grace period ensures ongoing coverage even if a payment isn't made promptly, supporting the legitimacy of submitting the policy later during claim processing by ComfortCare Claims.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="ae6d0ff9-f5aa-4f56-b0e3-b2f05381b7ef">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 30-day grace period provides critical context for understanding the consequences of failing to meet the $87.50 monthly premium requirement stated in the first fact.</data>
      <data key="d4">enforces condition</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="12aa272e-14b0-400c-bfb5-be55b12c5085">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 30-day grace period provides leniency for missing the first-of-month premium deadline, ensuring continued coverage despite delayed payment.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="14c9a49e-b750-4ae4-9750-5cf3f57becb9">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 30-day grace period provides necessary flexibility for the bank draft payment method, accommodating delays or failures without immediate policy termination.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day grace period ensures continued validity of the policy, thereby protecting Linda Sue Johnson’s right to receive the death benefit upon Dorothy Mae Johnson’s passing.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables beneficiary right</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="41063a11-10c3-4717-8757-b3501e3deda2" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 30-day grace period ensures that even if a premium payment fails, the policy remains intact long enough to preserve Linda Sue Johnson’s status as beneficiary and eligibility for the death benefit.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
