    <edge source="81788182-7312-430d-b245-031e37d5c627" target="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5">
      <data key="d3">The availability of annual payment options depends on the existence of a known monthly premium amount, such as $87.50, to calculate the total yearly cost.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81788182-7312-430d-b245-031e37d5c627" target="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6">
      <data key="d3">The availability of annual payment options relies on the premise of a stable, unchanging monthly premium, ensuring consistent long-term affordability.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81788182-7312-430d-b245-031e37d5c627" target="12f1e363-6499-41cd-a6c7-5fcd25bfbdae">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence presents a flexible payment method that might help avoid triggering the cancellation condition described in the first sentence.</data>
      <data key="d4">prevents</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81788182-7312-430d-b245-031e37d5c627" target="71633f7c-5dc5-48fa-ac41-c71eba6fc01c">
      <data key="d3">Switching to annual payments is one of several possible adjustments to the standard monthly billing schedule. This change offers a different timing pattern compared to quarterly payments, allowing greater control over when premiums are paid.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6686d2ec-0ac5-44ab-a501-013790bb492e" target="81788182-7312-430d-b245-031e37d5c627">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">payment amount per month</data>
    </edge>
