    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="21b0fd78-d6a8-4010-a875-c24ec80a3ec5">
      <data key="d3">The slow buildup of cash value depends on continuous premium payments, such as the $87.50 monthly contribution specified.</data>
      <data key="d4">enabled by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6">
      <data key="d3">The slow accumulation of cash value depends on consistent payments, which are ensured by the unchanging monthly premium.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="936f48e0-3971-4136-b206-0582810a5f12">
      <data key="d3">The slow build-up of cash value reflects the cumulative effect of ongoing premium payments, which are consistently collected via automated monthly deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="33bb0f3a-ce2b-40f6-b221-f738e97e68f6">
      <data key="d3">The statement that the policy builds cash value slowly is supported by the concrete result of reaching approximately $3,200 in cash value after a decade, illustrating the long-term growth pattern.</data>
      <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="38b66940-133b-4c2b-b3be-b28ab1f9d404">
      <data key="d3">The slow buildup of cash value creates an asset base that enables future financial flexibility. This growing equity supports the option to borrow funds from the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="5da67648-ce09-4542-beb6-73a666a8a6f5">
      <data key="d3">The statement that the policy builds cash value slowly describes its long-term growth pattern, which is substantiated by the existence of a detailed table showing guaranteed cash values over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="c3965e85-d864-4e4d-835c-0b95792ef2ca">
      <data key="d3">The slow buildup of cash value over time enables the policyholder to later access that value through surrender. Without this accumulation, the option to surrender would have little practical meaning.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="5896cff7-b1d1-4a7d-97cc-db08bcac9b87">
      <data key="d3">The slow buildup of cash value emphasizes the policy’s long-term nature, making preservation of the original document important for future benefits like loans or surrender options. This context underscores why having the policy available when filing a claim is essential.</data>
      <data key="d4">indirectly supports</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="ae6d0ff9-f5aa-4f56-b0e3-b2f05381b7ef">
      <data key="d3">The slow accumulation of cash value depends on the sustained payment of the fixed monthly premium of $87.50 throughout the life of the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">enabled by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="12aa272e-14b0-400c-bfb5-be55b12c5085">
      <data key="d3">The slow accumulation of cash value implies sustained premium payments over many years, reinforcing the importance of paying premiums consistently on the first day of each month.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="14c9a49e-b750-4ae4-9750-5cf3f57becb9">
      <data key="d3">Slowly building cash value depends on consistent premium payments, such as those made via bank draft as specified in the first fact.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s slow accumulation of cash value enhances its total worth beyond the death benefit, which directly impacts the financial outcome for the named beneficiary, Linda Sue Johnson.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s slow accumulation of cash value, noted in fact_sentence_2, is relevant to the overall purpose of the insurance plan detailed in chunk_summary_1, particularly since it affects the total return and potential use of the policy beyond just death benefits.</data>
