      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 describes the right to surrender the policy for cash value while alive, whereas fact_sentence_2 explains the procedure for claiming benefits upon death. Together, they outline distinct methods by which policyholders or beneficiaries can access the policy’s financial value.</data>
