    <edge source="4844654e-86bc-47cb-85e6-ae14de73a306" target="5d80f781-df38-47eb-959b-57820fc3dcfa">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a certified death certificate is a mandatory step when filing a claim, which begins by contacting the insurer at the specified hotline.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4844654e-86bc-47cb-85e6-ae14de73a306" target="9cd5bddf-be52-46cc-91cf-2bc14462b3ce">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a certified death certificate supports the overall verification needed to initiate a claim, enabling the processing of the subsequent claim form.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4844654e-86bc-47cb-85e6-ae14de73a306" target="5896cff7-b1d1-4a7d-97cc-db08bcac9b87">
      <data key="d3">The necessity of submitting a certified death certificate ensures proof of the insured's passing, which directly enables the next step: verifying ownership through the original policy document when available.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4844654e-86bc-47cb-85e6-ae14de73a306" target="d3df2cb3-d5f3-464e-bb7d-8d51ca52e9aa">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the necessity of a certified death certificate for claiming benefits, which is explicitly carried out by fact_sentence_2 through directing its mailing to ComfortCare Claims.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4844654e-86bc-47cb-85e6-ae14de73a306" target="b43f297a-8427-44c6-b3de-7251ec721e34">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a certified death certificate for a claim is supported by providing the correct mailing address where such documentation should be sent.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4844654e-86bc-47cb-85e6-ae14de73a306" target="1e415829-df4a-46be-a508-364a4dce0af3">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 mandates submission of a certified death certificate, while fact_sentence_2 directs where to send the completed claim form, together forming essential parts of the claim initiation process.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
