      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is part of the required procedure for beneficiaries seeking payout, including those whose deceased loved ones died in circumstances covered by the lack of a war exclusion.</data>
      <data key="d4">relevant condition</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9cd5bddf-be52-46cc-91cf-2bc14462b3ce" target="5d80f781-df38-47eb-959b-57820fc3dcfa">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is essential for processing, and contacting customer service ensures proper guidance during this step.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9cd5bddf-be52-46cc-91cf-2bc14462b3ce" target="4844654e-86bc-47cb-85e6-ae14de73a306">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form depends on having a certified death certificate, as it provides necessary proof of the insured's passing to validate the claim.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9cd5bddf-be52-46cc-91cf-2bc14462b3ce" target="5896cff7-b1d1-4a7d-97cc-db08bcac9b87">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is required alongside providing the original policy document when filing a claim. Both items serve essential roles in validating and processing the claim.</data>
      <data key="d4">necessary complement</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9cd5bddf-be52-46cc-91cf-2bc14462b3ce" target="3b7d9a54-071a-48e0-b6f6-572e65aacf95">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is a prerequisite step, and mailing the policy supports verification during the claims process by providing proof of coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9cd5bddf-be52-46cc-91cf-2bc14462b3ce" target="d3df2cb3-d5f3-464e-bb7d-8d51ca52e9aa">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 requires submission of a completed claim form, which supports the action described in fact_sentence_2—mailing a certified death certificate—as part of the full documentation needed to initiate a claim.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
