      <data key="d3">Submitting the original policy document is essential for claiming benefits, which requires ongoing premium payments like the $87.50 monthly fee to keep the policy active.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5896cff7-b1d1-4a7d-97cc-db08bcac9b87" target="c010d3b9-4e44-4905-87bb-9b9c8f2843d6">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to submit the original policy during claims implies that the policy must remain intact and held by the insured or designated party, making ongoing premium payments critical to maintain ownership and validity.</data>
      <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5896cff7-b1d1-4a7d-97cc-db08bcac9b87" target="12f1e363-6499-41cd-a6c7-5fcd25bfbdae">
      <data key="d3">The necessity to submit the original policy when filing a claim implies that the policy must remain active; otherwise, failure to maintain coverage could result in cancellation, rendering the document unavailable.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5896cff7-b1d1-4a7d-97cc-db08bcac9b87" target="d20b41a1-58d8-4490-b23e-4806e8417373">
      <data key="d3">Submitting the original policy is necessary to initiate a claim, ensuring that documentation verifies coverage details such as accumulated cash value, which has been built up gradually over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
