      <data key="d3">Mailing the claim form initiates the claims process, during which the insurer evaluates the policy’s cash value to determine the reduced benefit amount payable under specific conditions.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
