      <data key="d3">Timely payment ensures the policy stays active beyond the grace period, allowing the beneficiary to proceed with claiming benefits, making adherence to payment terms essential for fulfilling the instruction in fact_sentence_2.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
