    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="e96a90d3-556d-4069-8f21-af575f151db0">
      <data key="d3">The ability to cancel the policy for a full refund depends on the availability of the 30-day free look period, which serves as the legal basis for such a refundable cancellation.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="4fa853dd-d204-4e19-ad35-0235ef00f1f0">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look period starts upon receipt of the policy, enabling the policyholder to cancel it later during that timeframe for a full refund.</data>
      <data key="d4">preceded by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="0cc9a4bc-69ec-4b54-9801-99b95ba12f80">
      <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy during the 30-day free look period allows policyholders to exit without penalty early on. This freedom complements other flexible features like changing beneficiaries at any time.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look period enables full refunds upon cancellation, aligning with the broader right to access cash value when terminating the policy, reinforcing the flexibility of early exit options.</data>
      <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="90a0bf93-4726-45a8-be6a-15b19f92a2cc">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look enables immediate cancellation without penalty, providing a safety net that could lead to reconsideration and eventual reinstatement later. This sets up potential for re-engagement even after initial termination.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="c9e7b542-afe9-4463-8362-f1e619e1c1fa">
      <data key="d3">If a policyholder cancels during the free look period, they may later seek to restore coverage by paying overdue premiums plus interest, assuming reinstatement remains eligible.</data>
      <data key="d4">leads to reinstatement</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="6f5e1101-0f4f-4e81-8e61-d356e62a3dc6">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look allows cancellation for a full refund, which aligns with the policy being guaranteed issue—since no medical screening occurs, the insurer offers this grace period to protect consumers from unintended commitments.</data>
      <data key="d4">justified by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 30-day free look period means the policy could be canceled early, potentially nullifying the beneficiary designation of Linda Sue Johnson unless the policy is maintained beyond this period.</data>
      <data key="d4">affects beneficiary</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look period allows Dorothy Mae Johnson to cancel the policy before it becomes irrevocable, potentially nullifying Linda Sue Johnson’s status as beneficiary unless the policy remains in force.</data>
      <data key="d4">affects beneficiary</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f" target="4c8ec929-5e52-462b-92a8-e41444e69626">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 30-day free look period reinforces the appeal of a guaranteed issue whole life policy by providing a safety net during initial enrollment, especially given no medical exam requirement.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances understanding</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
