      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look period commences on the day the policyholder receives the policy, making the timing of receipt critical to exercising this right.</data>
      <data key="d4">starts</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4fa853dd-d204-4e19-ad35-0235ef00f1f0" target="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f">
      <data key="d3">The timing of the 30-day free look period is determined by when the policyholder receives the policy, making the refund eligibility contingent on this event.</data>
      <data key="d4">starts</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4fa853dd-d204-4e19-ad35-0235ef00f1f0" target="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look allows the policyholder to evaluate the policy upon receipt, providing a window during which they may decide to terminate it and access the cash value without penalty.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4fa853dd-d204-4e19-ad35-0235ef00f1f0" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look provision allows the policyholder, Dorothy Mae Johnson, to review the policy upon receipt, ensuring informed consent prior to finalizing the contract that designates Linda Sue Johnson as the primary beneficiary.</data>
      <data key="d4">contextual relationship</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4fa853dd-d204-4e19-ad35-0235ef00f1f0" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look period applies to the policy held by Dorothy Mae Johnson, whose daughter Linda Sue Johnson is listed as the sole beneficiary, making the timeline relevant to any future claims or cancellations involving the beneficiary.</data>
      <data key="d4">related to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4fa853dd-d204-4e19-ad35-0235ef00f1f0" target="3db72c0f-58a3-4898-8687-ac607777538b">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look allows the policyholder to review and possibly void the policy before commitment, though its outcome doesn’t override the pre-designated beneficiary status unless cancellation occurs prior to death.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4fa853dd-d204-4e19-ad35-0235ef00f1f0" target="4c8ec929-5e52-462b-92a8-e41444e69626">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look provision mentioned in fact_sentence_2 applies specifically to policies like the one detailed in fact_sentence_1, where no medical exam is required and early claims may have limited payouts.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
    </edge>
