      <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is the official method to change a beneficiary, which might follow up on a prior phone call to ComfortCare for guidance or confirmation.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0cc9a4bc-69ec-4b54-9801-99b95ba12f80" target="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f">
      <data key="d3">Policyholders may modify beneficiaries by submitting a written request, reflecting ongoing administrative flexibility. This capability supports overall policy management alongside options such as cancelling during the free look period.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0cc9a4bc-69ec-4b54-9801-99b95ba12f80" target="fea6b7a5-3ae3-4bad-b535-981ef6dae0c6">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is the procedural method through which a policyholder exercises their right to change their beneficiary at any time.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0cc9a4bc-69ec-4b54-9801-99b95ba12f80" target="f416fdfb-665d-40d1-a5b0-42d8b1a53b00">
      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 presents submitting a written request as a way to change a beneficiary, whereas fact sentence 1 offers calling ComfortCare as another available option. These are alternate procedures for achieving the same outcome.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative method</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0cc9a4bc-69ec-4b54-9801-99b95ba12f80" target="1041bf2f-c9a6-4ed4-9190-43134b349c16">
      <data key="d3">Changing a beneficiary requires a written request, but this action is subject to the overarching condition that the individual must meet the age requirements to qualify for the policy in the first place.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
