    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="f67c65a1-7ca1-4659-9ab6-9e37f547e284">
      <data key="d3">Policy portability allows coverage to remain active when moving across state lines, potentially necessitating communication with ComfortCare for updates or inquiries about transfer procedures.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="fea6b7a5-3ae3-4bad-b535-981ef6dae0c6">
      <data key="d3">Policy portability allows holders to maintain coverage when relocating, supporting the flexibility already demonstrated by the right to modify beneficiaries at any time.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="556e501c-b17a-4e61-b49d-34661d54a32a">
      <data key="d3">The policy's portability allows it to remain active regardless of the policyholder’s relocation to a different state.</data>
      <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="2037f96e-c50f-40b7-a609-fab5cbf6d95c">
      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 highlights the policy’s portability across states, allowing holders to maintain coverage regardless of location changes. This feature complements the automatic continuation of coverage described in fact sentence 2, ensuring sustained protection even without active premium payments.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f">
      <data key="d3">Policy portability ensures coverage remains intact across states, and the reduced benefit upon lapse depends directly on the policy's accumulated cash value, making the financial basis of continued protection clear.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42">
      <data key="d3">The portability of the policy allows the holder to maintain coverage when moving states, providing flexibility that complements the right to access cash value upon cancellation.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="90a0bf93-4726-45a8-be6a-15b19f92a2cc">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s portability ensures coverage remains intact when moving across states, supporting continued eligibility for reinstatement if payments lapse within the specified timeframe.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="6f5e1101-0f4f-4e81-8e61-d356e62a3dc6">
      <data key="d3">Policy portability allows holders to maintain coverage when moving states, regardless of health status. This feature complements the policy’s guaranteed-issue nature, where no medical information is needed during enrollment.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s portability allows continued coverage across state lines, ensuring that even if Dorothy Mae Johnson relocates, her daughter Linda Sue Johnson retains eligibility to receive the death benefit as originally designated.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">Policy portability ensures the continuity of the beneficiary arrangement, allowing Linda Sue Johnson to receive the death benefit even if Dorothy Mae Johnson moves states.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="3db72c0f-58a3-4898-8687-ac607777538b">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s portability ensures continued validity and transferability, which upholds the conditions under which Linda Sue Johnson can claim the full death benefit as the designated beneficiary.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances validity</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8" target="4c8ec929-5e52-462b-92a8-e41444e69626">
      <data key="d3">The portability of the policy, noted in fact_sentence_2, directly supports the usability and long-term viability of the guaranteed issue whole life policy detailed in fact_sentence_1, especially given its no-exam nature and lifelong premium stability.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
