    <edge source="556e501c-b17a-4e61-b49d-34661d54a32a" target="b43f297a-8427-44c6-b3de-7251ec721e34">
      <data key="d3">Policy portability allows continued coverage when moving states, ensuring that the policyholder can still use the designated mailing address for claims without disruption.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="556e501c-b17a-4e61-b49d-34661d54a32a" target="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8">
      <data key="d3">The policy staying with the policyholder upon moving indicates its portability across state boundaries.</data>
      <data key="d4">implied by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="556e501c-b17a-4e61-b49d-34661d54a32a" target="2037f96e-c50f-40b7-a609-fab5cbf6d95c">
      <data key="d3">Policy portability allows holders to maintain coverage when relocating, while continued coverage post-two-year lapse ensures ongoing protection despite non-payment. These features independently enhance policy durability.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="556e501c-b17a-4e61-b49d-34661d54a32a" target="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f">
      <data key="d3">Policy portability allows continued coverage when moving states, ensuring uninterrupted access to benefits. This ongoing status enables the use of accumulated cash value to determine any reduced benefit upon lapse.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="556e501c-b17a-4e61-b49d-34661d54a32a" target="14c6f6e0-3784-4339-b112-6c08c2eb1083">
      <data key="d3">Policy portability allows the holder to maintain coverage when moving states, supporting ongoing eligibility for continued benefits. This enables the policy’s automatic transition into reduced-benefit status without premiums, preserving some protection despite non-payment.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="556e501c-b17a-4e61-b49d-34661d54a32a" target="90a0bf93-4726-45a8-be6a-15b19f92a2cc">
      <data key="d3">The policy's ability to remain active when moving states supports long-term ownership, enabling future reinstatement options. However, this does not affect the timeline or conditions for restarting coverage post-payment lapse.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="23a6b6bc-f456-40a7-9f5f-14e2a1cd1931" target="556e501c-b17a-4e61-b49d-34661d54a32a">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">is portable across states</data>
    </edge>
