      <data key="d3">The reduced benefit amount relies on the policy’s accumulated cash value, which influences the final payment made after submitting proof such as a death certificate.</data>
      <data key="d4">informs</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="1e415829-df4a-46be-a508-364a4dce0af3">
      <data key="d3">The reduced benefit amount, derived from the policy’s cash value, determines what the claimant receives upon submission of the claim form, influencing the outcome of the filing process.</data>
      <data key="d4">determines</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="3b7d9a54-071a-48e0-b6f6-572e65aacf95">
      <data key="d3">The reduced benefit depends on the policy’s cash value, so having access to the physical policy via mailing ensures accurate assessment of that value.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="b43f297a-8427-44c6-b3de-7251ec721e34">
      <data key="d3">The reduced benefit amount relies on the policy’s cash value, which may require supporting evidence submitted via the designated mailing address.</data>
      <data key="d4">informs</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="63aa8cb9-583b-4b5a-8fe0-2626eeaf7628">
      <data key="d3">The reduced benefit level depends on the policy’s cash value, which determines the maximum payable amount when claims are processed within five business days.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8">
      <data key="d3">The reliance on cash value to determine the reduced benefit enables the policy to remain active even if premiums stop, supporting its portability feature through sustained benefit levels regardless of location.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="556e501c-b17a-4e61-b49d-34661d54a32a">
      <data key="d3">The reduced benefit depends on the policy's cash value, which supports continuation of coverage—even if the policyholder relocates—ensuring that financial value persists despite mobility.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="2037f96e-c50f-40b7-a609-fab5cbf6d95c">
      <data key="d3">The policy's continued operation post-two-year lapse relies on its accumulated cash value, which determines the level of reduced benefits received while the policy stays in force.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="23ea9eda-ab01-439d-8c9f-2e04c0f63d59">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s reduced benefit upon non-payment stems from its reliance on accumulated cash value, meaning the cash value directly dictates the level of continued protection.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="14c6f6e0-3784-4339-b112-6c08c2eb1083">
      <data key="d3">The reduced benefit relies on the policy’s accumulated cash value, enabling it to continue without further premium payments. This financial foundation allows the policy to remain active even after premium cessation.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42">
      <data key="d3">If the policy’s cash value supports a reduced benefit, it also enables the policyholder to withdraw it entirely and terminate coverage. This choice depends on the existing cash value level described in the first sentence.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="90a0bf93-4726-45a8-be6a-15b19f92a2cc">
      <data key="d3">The reduced benefit depends on the policy’s cash value, which serves as the foundation for maintaining coverage if reinstated. This preserved cash value allows the policyholder to reactivate the policy within two years without needing new underwriting.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="c9e7b542-afe9-4463-8362-f1e619e1c1fa">
      <data key="d3">The reduced benefit relies on the policy’s accumulated cash value, which also determines eligibility and cost for reinstatement by covering unpaid premiums with interest.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s provision allowing reduced benefits via cash value impacts the actual amount Linda Sue Johnson could receive, making her role contingent on whether the policy remains active or lapses.</data>
      <data key="d4">affected by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">The reduction in benefit tied to the policy’s cash value (fact_sentence_2) affects the payout to Linda Sue Johnson, whose status as primary beneficiary was established in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">impacts beneficiary</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="3db72c0f-58a3-4898-8687-ac607777538b">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a reduced benefit based on cash value implies that Linda Sue Johnson might receive less than 100% of the death benefit if premiums are not maintained, thus qualifying her full entitlement only conditionally.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f" target="4c8ec929-5e52-462b-92a8-e41444e69626">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 clarifies how the policy from fact_sentence_1 functions financially during lapses, specifically explaining that reduced benefits derive directly from the policy’s cash value, reinforcing its long-term financial design.</data>
      <data key="d4">explains mechanism</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
