    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="e96a90d3-556d-4069-8f21-af575f151db0">
      <data key="d3">The ability to take the cash value and cancel the policy is made meaningful by the 30-day free look period, which legally permits such action without financial loss during the initial term.</data>
      <data key="d4">is enabled by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="dc94da25-01fa-41ec-97bf-06bd13328b2f">
      <data key="d3">The option to take the cash value supports cancellation at any time, including during the 30-day free look period, where such action leads to a full refund through the same mechanism.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="4fa853dd-d204-4e19-ad35-0235ef00f1f0">
      <data key="d3">The right to take the cash value and cancel the policy is enabled by the 30-day free look period, which gives the policyholder time to assess whether to keep or exit the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">enabled by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="10e87b42-cc43-4448-a557-8ed5882b14c8">
      <data key="d3">The ability to take the cash value and cancel the policy offers a financial exit strategy, which may influence decisions about whether to exercise the policy’s portability feature.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="2037f96e-c50f-40b7-a609-fab5cbf6d95c">
      <data key="d3">The policyholder may elect to receive the cash value and end the policy, rather than allowing it to remain active through use of accumulated funds.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="23ea9eda-ab01-439d-8c9f-2e04c0f63d59">
      <data key="d3">The option to take the cash value cancels the policy, avoiding further reductions in benefits by exiting the plan entirely rather than letting it continue with diminished value.</data>
      <data key="d4">prevents reduction</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="bbe3a5e7-9762-4606-beaf-78b057d4a71f">
      <data key="d3">Choosing to take the cash value implies accepting a reduction in benefits, since the policy ceases once the cash value is withdrawn, aligning with the mechanism where reduced benefits rely on that same cash value.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="14c6f6e0-3784-4339-b112-6c08c2eb1083">
      <data key="d3">Choosing to take the cash value cancels the policy, meaning the automatic continuation under reduced benefit does not occur.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="90a0bf93-4726-45a8-be6a-15b19f92a2cc">
      <data key="d3">Taking the cash value allows the policyholder to terminate coverage while retaining monetary value. This preserved value facilitates potential future reinstatement if done within the allowed timeframe.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="c9e7b542-afe9-4463-8362-f1e619e1c1fa">
      <data key="d3">If a policyholder takes the cash value and cancels the policy, they may later seek to restore it by paying overdue premiums with interest during the reinstatement window.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="2c2ac373-cacf-48f8-8261-4cacaba45a95">
      <data key="d3">Taking the cash value allows cancellation of the policy, which may affect how benefits are paid out if death occurs during the early years when a graded benefit applies.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="9740e07b-e5dc-49f2-906f-8809e5ba6736">
      <data key="d3">The designation of Linda Sue Johnson as the primary beneficiary depends on the policy terms allowing surrender and withdrawal of cash value, which enables her to receive funds upon cancellation.</data>
      <data key="d4">related to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="26f6013f-3536-4d6f-bb66-a0f48884cc23">
      <data key="d3">The option to withdraw cash value from the policy affects the outcome of Linda Sue Johnson’s role as beneficiary, since it determines whether she receives a death benefit or no payment at all.</data>
      <data key="d4">impacts beneficiary</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42" target="4c8ec929-5e52-462b-92a8-e41444e69626">
      <data key="d3">The option to take cash value and cancel the policy applies directly to the guaranteed issue whole life policy described in fact_sentence_1, which permits such actions after two years without requiring further underwriting.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d838452c-ef79-4766-b61e-bcd8f1ad32ec" target="3f2c8f57-1f5d-48e3-8f16-209ff8908d42">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">can be cancelled</data>
    </edge>
