      <data key="d3">The absence of medical questions ensures broad accessibility, yet applicants must still meet specific age-based eligibility thresholds to qualify.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6f5e1101-0f4f-4e81-8e61-d356e62a3dc6" target="86ca68dd-fb6f-4cc6-88f5-306def695d50">
      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the policy was issued without medical questions, meaning applicants were not asked about their health history. This directly implies that no medical exams were required, making it consistent with fact sentence 2.</data>
      <data key="d4">equivalent to</data>
