      <data key="d3">Since no medical questions or exams were required, the policy has a graded benefit, meaning that if a claim occurs early, only a portion of the face amount may be paid—a condition relevant to how claims like those requiring a death certificate are processed.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
