      <data key="d3">ComfortCare Senior Insurance issues the policy and operates under the name COMFORT; therefore, its toll-free customer service line serves as an official point of contact for policyholders.</data>
      <data key="d4">has contact info</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
