      <data key="d3">The policy was signed on May 1, 2024, confirming active enrollment during the effective period. Since the insured is 82—a qualifying age—the timing of sign-up ensures compliance with age restrictions.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
