      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 identifies the effective date of the policy, which determines when the conditions in fact_sentence_1 may begin to take effect. Without this date, it would be impossible to assess whether the two-year threshold referenced in fact_sentence_1 has been met.</data>
